# Rune cheatsheet

Anything that is not typing into a buffer is a command. Open the command
prompt with `{{.CommandKey}}`, type a command name, and press `<enter>` to
run it. This sheet leads with the key and names the command it runs.

To close this cheatsheet press `{{key "windowclose"}}`.

## Getting started

| Key | Action |
| --- | --- |
| `{{.CommandKey}}` | Open the command prompt |
{{- if .Modal}}
| `<ctrl-j>` / `<ctrl-k>` | Move down / up through the results |
{{- else}}
| `<up>` / `<down>` | Move through the results |
{{- end}}
| `<enter>` | Run the selected command |
| `<esc>` / `<ctrl-c>` | Dismiss the command prompt |
| `<tab>` | Complete the current command name |

